  title="Domino: Causal Quality at Parallel Speed | Catpuccino.ai"
  description="Domino decouples causal dependency modeling from autoregressive execution in speculative decoding — a lightweight GRU head adds causal correction on top of a block-parallel drafter, boosting acceptance length 16.6% and end-to-end speedup 12.3% with only 2.8% more latency."
  crumb="Domino"
>

