  <p>The headline numbers: on Qwen3-8B with greedy decoding, Domino improves over DFlash from 4.66× to <strong>5.49× average speedup</strong> (17.8% relative gain). The peak is <strong>7.92× on GSM8K</strong>, where acceptance length reaches τ = 10.03. On sampling (T=1), average speedup goes from 3.96× (DFlash) to 4.46× (Domino).</p>

